    ("Las brujas no envejecen. Se arrugan con estilo.", "Witches don't age. They wrinkle with style."),
    ("El sombrero de bruja es puntiagudo para que no se posen hadas. Funciona.", "A witch's hat is pointy so pixies can't land on it. It works."),
    ("Cocinan con murciélagos. Las tartas, por suerte, no.", "They cook with bats. The cakes, luckily, not."),
    ("Una bruja me invitó a pasar. Era la puerta del sótano. No entré.", "A witch invited me in. It was the cellar door. I didn't go."),
